{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：23:00 2026-09-30 HKT</p>\n\n<p>首屆亞洲小姐冠軍黎燕珊日前宣布再婚，在一對子女「舉腳贊成」下，將於明年與男友結婚，這段黃昏戀修成正果，甜蜜迎接人生第二春。黎燕珊曾表示離婚對她傷痛很大，雖然一直也有不少追求者，當中不乏事業有成的好男人，但她礙於當時一對仔女年紀尚小，擔心仔女不能接受新爸爸，所以年多年來獨力撫養一對子女，直到仔女已經長大，黎燕珊亦決定放開心扉，在今年情人節大方認愛，不時偕同新歡Joseph Cheng高調出席與圈中好友的聚會，大晒甜蜜。</p>\n<h2>黎燕珊自認四十八孝媽媽</h2>\n<p>近日黎燕珊為TVB節目《流行都市》擔任嘉賓，雖然她近年在劇中飾演壞媽媽，但在現實中，黎燕珊是廿四孝媽媽：「我唔覺得我自己不單止二十四，我係四十八孝呀！真係！我因為我係一個媽咪，又係一個 daddy 啦，所以所有嘢都係你嘅啦。我自從知道自己要行呢條路，單親媽咪之後呢，我就每一樣嘢都要好紮根、好努力。」</p>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊離婚多年，早前透露覓得第二春。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b75cf15fc2b48cb512ce6e7b1f1ae436/2026-02/Lai_13_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊2月初已曝光戀情。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/87ebcf423d44ff9a0dcda7b808617c9c/2026-02/Lai_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊多度放閃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cbbea6d40e11158071b15f53d3fcae81/2026-02/Lai_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊今年情人節晒合照公開戀情。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1a46765dbc7331cb4dd3c0b6819379e1/2026-02/Lai_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊Tag男友名字，「黎燕珊和Joseph Cheng在一起」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c8d1ee7004481fd7c9595af429daf69b/2026-02/3059_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊的男友已融入其朋友圈，不時結伴出席聚會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4b00dae763f0cbc0913d810ce8145d78/2026-09/LAI_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊亮相TVB節目《流行都市》，男友陪伴在側。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8162a9ade23b06f51f933eb97c7d354c/2026-09/LAI_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊（右）昨日（28日）亮相TVB節目《流行都市》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ceebd594c8477ad6cfd069958544c87a/2026-09/LAI_11_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊在訪問時大談家庭。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1a51bb81e58526fc483f68aa728ecdf8/2026-09/LAI_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊分享近況。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f222fba799af5553d08c0a8ed4be5ac0/2026-09/LAI_29_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊拍拖表示獲仔女支持。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a8c34b64d5b9aaff43b5b5b82efc0712/2026-09/LAI_34_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊提到男友笑逐顏開。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/48a0c3af97bf903c14876ff5c1488c4f/2026-09/LAI_44_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊公布明年再婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4c3f8ea641bb601bad010496e09cbc6d/2026-09/LAI_46_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"2000年爆出劉永家暴兼有外遇，黎燕珊提出離婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/900b387e2dd41f432764a5b2d05e61db/2025-12/Ena10g25.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊1992年與劉永結婚後，淡出演藝圈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/56df12dbe703421180c7b0dbf372c6a3/2023-05/ena09g25.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊與劉永在2000年離婚，一度鬧上法庭。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0043acb748037af7b4b8ced9b5712aa6/2023-05/ea01b17.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊多年來未曾向子女說父親劉永不是。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0067d640a1c485bb183a5f8d5a270f09/2023-05/7v3x6975.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊分享合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/81da222d96af6253a2a4a72d2f9bdc04/2026-02/Lai_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊大晒幸福。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e92d807694c4ed52ce94638294ff42df/2026-02/Lai_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"估計黎燕珊在教會覓得「黃昏戀」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/17e9ff317e8e61fcb6e8ac5fdcfaff80/2026-02/Lai_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊早前去教會活動，另一半也有同行。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3c440de7f184c8163550d161b8b6a7e8/2026-02/Lai_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊與新歡早前到東莞參加退修團活動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b02fa75402475d1bbcb2afc75079c0e9/2026-02/Lai_9_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊曾透露與另一半要有共同信仰。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b7f0fbff203cc0740b1222d0fdd602f1/2026-02/Lai_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊與男友穿情侶裝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1a78ff86c347deedae955a22ab1dafc1/2026-06/Eva_13_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊帶男友與朋友聚會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ac07685895d4ca83cf320e35b43a13ca/2026-06/Eva_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊在多張合照中靠實男友。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/758b943fc559921d0dc9305167b44788/2026-06/Eva_14_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊與男友糖黐豆。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c675595a85363a9359d339ed2b718eb6/2026-06/Eva_15_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊當日穿上粉色襯衫，而男友以搶眼粉紅色西裝外套襯女友。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/41237a13a4f52e89c69d7e0995a52856/2026-06/Eva_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊去年底亮相好友鍾慧冰的YouTube頻道訪問。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/11272c14a643a92faea02f50f43ff2e7/2025-12/cap_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊罕有談及感情生活。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/034a810edb0279ccb5bce3061e02f4b3/2025-12/cap_23_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊被鍾慧冰重提離婚舊事。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d9d920e0677957f4a173dfa1a114e45f/2025-12/cap_24_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾慧冰笑問感情生活，黎燕珊哈哈大笑說：「我知你想問乜，搵返個黃昏係咪呀，哈哈哈！」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f19193b58c427b7dc4dc81567935022b/2025-12/cap_47_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊笑到要用手按眼角魚尾紋。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7d84f027371c835035013518063de9f8/2025-12/cap_51_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊被問到會否考慮再婚時，坦承有憧憬。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/85af091009080aa1c34abbefcb40e564/2025-12/cap_56_.jpg\"/>\n<h2>黎燕珊教仔女做任何事都要諗後果</h2>\n<p>亞姐出身黎燕珊當時受亞視力捧，不過在1992年與劉永結婚並淡出演藝圈，婚後育有一子一女，本來一家生活得很開心，但在2000年兩夫妻關係嚴重決裂，黎燕珊提出離婚申請，並向高等法院申請禁制令，禁止劉永接觸自己及子女。雖然劉永其後曾在媒體前落淚並向她表示悔意，但兩人終在2004年正式離婚。在節目上，黎燕珊坦言當時很徬徨：「我記得最差嘅時候係唔知點算，我成日諗，我點樣可以養大佢哋呢？我點樣可以帶住，因為我自己一個就簡單，但係帶住兩個小朋友就一定都唔係簡單。我喺學前教育唔係好點樣識得去教佢哋，但係我喺人生嘅道理上面，做好自己，身教好緊要。我會教佢哋係做任何嘢都要諗後果啦，同埋要有責任，一定要做好自己。我係有底線嘅，佢哋幾個底線呢，都好乖，冇做到，好似我話我唔鍾意你哋揸電單車啦、唔准食煙、唔准紋身，呢啲佢哋都冇做，佢哋係好錫媽咪。」</p>\n<h2>黎燕珊要有返自己人生價值觀</h2>\n<p>黎燕珊的女兒已婚兼誕下女兒，三代同堂的黎燕珊被問是否有孫萬事足？她笑說：「我唔使日日去湊嘅，間唔中去玩吓、照顧吓。譬如佢哋可能屋企停電，就走過嚟，近期有一次最難忘就係，我孫女返學喇，返N班，佢人生第一次嘛，所以我婆婆一定要帶佢去開學。好多迴響，好開心，我好正能量、好正面，好重要。」不過最令大家感到開心，當然是黎燕珊終於有個伴，而且男友更得到仔女的認可：「其實我冇特別去搵，我覺得呢個係姻緣、緣份，因為大家識咗二十幾年，係一個教友，呢個緣份就好得意呀，喺呢兩年彰顯咗呢件事出嚟，我啲仔女都好支持，冇意見，如果我哋有意見嗰陣，仲成日『爭』佢添。我阿珊姐從來都要覺得女人一定要靚，如果有姻緣要拍拖呢，八十歲都要拍拖，我而家放工㗎喇嘛，啲仔女大晒啦，我要有返自己嘅人生價值觀先得，冇理由自己一個人long time lonely㗎嘛。」</p>\n<p></p>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊離婚多年，早前透露覓得第二春。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b75cf15fc2b48cb512ce6e7b1f1ae436/2026-02/Lai_13_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊2月初已曝光戀情。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/87ebcf423d44ff9a0dcda7b808617c9c/2026-02/Lai_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊多度放閃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cbbea6d40e11158071b15f53d3fcae81/2026-02/Lai_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊今年情人節晒合照公開戀情。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1a46765dbc7331cb4dd3c0b6819379e1/2026-02/Lai_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊Tag男友名字，「黎燕珊和Joseph Cheng在一起」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c8d1ee7004481fd7c9595af429daf69b/2026-02/3059_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊的男友已融入其朋友圈，不時結伴出席聚會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4b00dae763f0cbc0913d810ce8145d78/2026-09/LAI_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊亮相TVB節目《流行都市》，男友陪伴在側。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8162a9ade23b06f51f933eb97c7d354c/2026-09/LAI_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊（右）昨日（28日）亮相TVB節目《流行都市》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ceebd594c8477ad6cfd069958544c87a/2026-09/LAI_11_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊在訪問時大談家庭。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1a51bb81e58526fc483f68aa728ecdf8/2026-09/LAI_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊分享近況。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f222fba799af5553d08c0a8ed4be5ac0/2026-09/LAI_29_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊拍拖表示獲仔女支持。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a8c34b64d5b9aaff43b5b5b82efc0712/2026-09/LAI_34_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊提到男友笑逐顏開。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/48a0c3af97bf903c14876ff5c1488c4f/2026-09/LAI_44_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊公布明年再婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4c3f8ea641bb601bad010496e09cbc6d/2026-09/LAI_46_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"2000年爆出劉永家暴兼有外遇，黎燕珊提出離婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/900b387e2dd41f432764a5b2d05e61db/2025-12/Ena10g25.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊1992年與劉永結婚後，淡出演藝圈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/56df12dbe703421180c7b0dbf372c6a3/2023-05/ena09g25.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊與劉永在2000年離婚，一度鬧上法庭。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0043acb748037af7b4b8ced9b5712aa6/2023-05/ea01b17.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊多年來未曾向子女說父親劉永不是。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0067d640a1c485bb183a5f8d5a270f09/2023-05/7v3x6975.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊分享合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/81da222d96af6253a2a4a72d2f9bdc04/2026-02/Lai_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊大晒幸福。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e92d807694c4ed52ce94638294ff42df/2026-02/Lai_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"估計黎燕珊在教會覓得「黃昏戀」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/17e9ff317e8e61fcb6e8ac5fdcfaff80/2026-02/Lai_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊早前去教會活動，另一半也有同行。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3c440de7f184c8163550d161b8b6a7e8/2026-02/Lai_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊與新歡早前到東莞參加退修團活動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b02fa75402475d1bbcb2afc75079c0e9/2026-02/Lai_9_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊曾透露與另一半要有共同信仰。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b7f0fbff203cc0740b1222d0fdd602f1/2026-02/Lai_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊與男友穿情侶裝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1a78ff86c347deedae955a22ab1dafc1/2026-06/Eva_13_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊帶男友與朋友聚會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ac07685895d4ca83cf320e35b43a13ca/2026-06/Eva_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊在多張合照中靠實男友。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/758b943fc559921d0dc9305167b44788/2026-06/Eva_14_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊與男友糖黐豆。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c675595a85363a9359d339ed2b718eb6/2026-06/Eva_15_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊當日穿上粉色襯衫，而男友以搶眼粉紅色西裝外套襯女友。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/41237a13a4f52e89c69d7e0995a52856/2026-06/Eva_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊去年底亮相好友鍾慧冰的YouTube頻道訪問。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/11272c14a643a92faea02f50f43ff2e7/2025-12/cap_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊罕有談及感情生活。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/034a810edb0279ccb5bce3061e02f4b3/2025-12/cap_23_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊被鍾慧冰重提離婚舊事。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d9d920e0677957f4a173dfa1a114e45f/2025-12/cap_24_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾慧冰笑問感情生活，黎燕珊哈哈大笑說：「我知你想問乜，搵返個黃昏係咪呀，哈哈哈！」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f19193b58c427b7dc4dc81567935022b/2025-12/cap_47_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊笑到要用手按眼角魚尾紋。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7d84f027371c835035013518063de9f8/2025-12/cap_51_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊被問到會否考慮再婚時，坦承有憧憬。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/85af091009080aa1c34abbefcb40e564/2025-12/cap_56_.jpg\"/>\n<h2>黎燕珊自認「享樂型外婆」</h2>\n<p>提到女兒及外孫女，黎燕珊笑指自己定位是「享樂型外婆」：「又唔使我日日去湊，間唔中去玩下、照顧下。譬如佢哋得閒，或者屋企有咩事，就會走過嚟。」早前黎燕珊陪外孫女開學，她形容這是人生重要時刻：「近期最難忘就係我外孫女返學啦，返N班，佢人生第一次，所以我呢個婆婆一定要帶佢開學。好多回憶，好開心，好正能量，好正面，好開心。」</p>\n<h2>黎燕珊與劉永離婚逾20年</h2>\n<p>1985年首屆亞姐冠軍黎燕珊，於1992年嫁給邵氏出身的演員劉永，成為其第二任妻子。黎燕珊為劉永誕下一子一女，但二人於2000年傳出婚變。當時黎燕珊除了提出離婚申請外，更向高等法院申請禁制令，禁止劉永接觸自己及一對子女，最終雙方在2004年正式離婚。黎燕珊於今年情人節公開新戀情，此後不時帶同男友出席圈中友好聚會。</p>\n<img alt=\"62歲的黎燕珊已三代同堂。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fa98f14072afdc3c9cb6f817f96a5396/2026-06/Eva_17_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊經歷多年辛酸，終於捱大一對子女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d0a85ee20e04ae9ba0f5ef08c36ff835/2023-05/122357922_376579573697466_3127958655580363125_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊與仔女感情很好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/166120bf9d98c353a19f1d48f29fa8f3/2026-02/Lai_15_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊兩年前獲仔女邀去東京旅行慶祝生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/83d58727acb5e0e2a6e7799b0eec43b1/2026-02/Lai_14_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊為劉永誕下一女一子。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/62cbdb76ebbf9b8afc36231cc3ba7512/2026-02/enp13p04010103.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊離婚後，獨力湊大一對子女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1e18530115036677b08e5b1c9f9d77b7/2023-05/yijiasankou07.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"在千禧年代，黎燕珊曾為養家做保險。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d3bec4899f4a56d9506ef0f3c9ae4cd7/2023-05/033_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊與囡囡劉詠詩關係要好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a324818d2a06fd600ac6e57c1b527606/2023-05/whatsappimage2020-03-17at13.39.31.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉詠詩曾經經常陪媽媽出席活動，但未有正式入行。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/03588d3214b4a4335ca577b64ba4501f/2023-05/img_2501.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"做空姐是劉詠詩的夢想。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1588afd730c954137e0c58118710dd69/2023-05/116022315_280041933095161_8591616075115809731_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉詠詩做空姐。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c1fdbf6807bfd5f581c4f233bf94c54e/2023-05/292005730_1727667350917683_4626320704737500824_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉詠詩回歸空姐行列。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bd11998116593458b6b6ae6ad5012935/2023-06/lauwingsze_wyncelws_353556099_960915611795678_6699946791737631719_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曾晒泳照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5e5167f027e958b3fd2102b0a16fccf7/2023-05/24274552_360670504395745_6842301425616158720_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊榮升做婆婆。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f4ab7238e2db2896390f38209293e08d/2024-08/evalaiyinshan_1723797604_3435785791165174932_30985559138.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊女兒劉詠詩貼一家三口相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3598e6cabfa2ec4354cf8034f96d15d4/2024-11/eleana_cheng_1731925433_3503966960365441924_67734765199.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊大女2024年誕下女兒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6aeb5d8e0a6daeeae29eae96bc16dadf/2024-11/454659359_18337625161131832_3080853815075268431_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊榮升做婆婆。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a210c8d2f471cdde35c21fc182d46b03/2024-08/evalaiyinshan_1723797604_3435785791173570560_30985559138.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"女兒似十足媽咪。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0c98004260ce202a7674df9e528951c7/2024-11/eleana_cheng_1724864586_3444736284990994297_67734765199.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"B女全程望實鏡頭。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c3b2612cb4777d6411a0bb7800cde5bb/2024-11/eleana_cheng_1730110261_3488740189953220572_67734765199.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"露出萌爆笑容。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8f68e6d1d7788aedac0699ac31e0a20d/2024-11/eleana_cheng_1730110261_3488740190120916582_67734765199.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"BB表情多多。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b403d8c2baddfa4d9cfddb985cbdce8d/2024-11/eleana_cheng_1730110261_3488740189953092100_67734765199.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊大女劉詠詩於唯港薈擺婚宴暨弄瓦喜酒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/199cf0cf6d8b3bbf62b51d5faf27cafb/2025-06/WhatsApp_Image_2025-06-07_at_6_46_04_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊和媽媽合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5f8b2858cb837dcc8f7cb86003b309b6/2025-06/WhatsApp_Image_2025-06-07_at_6_46_05_PM_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊四代同堂合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3af011cff51738f9f2b4948c9787e88f/2025-06/WhatsApp_Image_2025-06-07_at_6_46_06_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊四代同堂合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e082b5f06dfa63e015bb92b13c548860/2025-06/WhatsApp_Image_2025-06-07_at_6_46_06_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉詠詩一家三口好幸福。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d1a07f5486ab168d6521e65ac1ee998a/2025-06/WhatsApp_Image_2025-06-07_at_6_46_07_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊的女兒已為人妻人母。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d0737d4f861b80cd899cab5f423a3625/2025-06/WhatsApp_Image_2025-06-07_at_6_46_07_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊孫女十分可愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e91db397b8a8b8f95076dde40243d7e8/2025-06/WhatsApp_Image_2025-06-07_at_6_46_07_PM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎燕珊指兒子（右）好事近。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f0343940c46882f02c04894c5aa36966/2025-06/WhatsApp_Image_2025-06-07_at_6_46_07_PM_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉詠詩和媽媽黎燕珊合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3f6627eb2b1f